  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kvinna till kvinna GBV and women economic empowerment Serbia 2022-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinna till kvinna GBV och kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt Serbien 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kvinna till kvinna and partner organisations influence improvements in policy and practice regarding GBV and women&apos;s economic empowerment.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinna till kvinna och samarbetsorganisationer p&#xe5;verkar f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar i policy och praxis n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller GBV och kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the contribution are:

Overall Programme objective: Kvinna till Kvinna and partner organisations influence improvements in policy and practice regarding gender-based violence and womens economic empowerment in Serbia.

Specific objective 1 - Partner organisations and other relevant actors reached within the Project contribute to changes in attitude, practice and policy regarding GBV, based on the Istanbul Convention 

Specific objective 2 - Organisations reached within the Project contribute to changes in policy and practice regarding womens economic empowerment.

Specific objective 3 - Increased sustainability and visibility of partner organisations and other relevant actors within the Project, and for their results</narrative>
  </description>
